  - {fileID: 725946647}
  - {fileID: 518710246}
  - {fileID: 59751727}
  farewells:
  - A title described a role. It was never the whole of you.
  - You were never meant to be reachable all the time.
  - Your worth was never a quarterly number.
  - Your loyalty is still yours. It goes with you.
  - You do not owe anyone a perfect explanation.
  feed: {fileID: 722043676}
  piles:
  - {fileID: 1352479191}
  - {fileID: 1423128297}
  - {fileID: 243457682}
  - {fileID: 1129776920}
  - {fileID: 171040611}
  strips: {fileID: 843612258}
  blankPage: {fileID: 928889561}
  choices: {fileID: 1091666217}
  blankText: {fileID: 604432088}
  lines:
  - I learn fast.
  - I care about people.
  - I keep going.
  - I make things better.
  line: 
